  "title": "Facilities Planning and Design",
  "description": "Facilities Planning and Design teaches students how to plan, evaluate, and implement facility layouts for manufacturing, warehousing, distribution, office, and service environments. Students study product-process inputs, flow and space relationships, layout types, computerized layout methods, material handling, warehouse design, location analysis, safety, ergonomics, sustainability, cost evaluation, simulation, and implementation planning.",
